{"at":"2026-02-20T20:55:26.427Z","userId":"admin","page":{"id":43,"status":"published","language":"en","path":"/general-information/what-are-the-legal-requirements-for-short-term-renting-in-andalucia/","title":"What are the legal requirements for short-term renting in Andalucía? • PropertyList Info Hub","description":"As a landlord renting short-term, you will need: Registration: If you are renting out a property in Andalusia for holiday rentals, short-term rentals, or as a tourist accommodation, you are generally required to register the property with the Andalusian Tourism Registry (Registro de Turismo de Andalucía). Each property must have a unique registration number.https://www.juntadeandalucia.es/organismos/turismoculturayde","body":"<!-- Google Tag Manager -->\n\n<!-- End Google Tag Manager -->\n\t\t\t\t\n        <!-- Theme Version -->\n        <meta name=\"docy-version\" content=\"3.3.5\">\n        <!-- Charset Meta -->\n        <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n        <!-- For IE -->\n        <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\">\n        <!-- For Responsive Device -->\n        <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\n        <title>What are the legal requirements for short-term renting in Andalucía? • PropertyList Info Hub</title>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t<!-- All in One SEO 4.7.8 - aioseo.com -->\n\t<meta name=\"description\" content=\"As a landlord renting short-term, you will need: Registration: If you are renting out a property in Andalusia for holiday rentals, short-term rentals, or as a tourist accommodation, you are generally required to register the property with the Andalusian Tourism Registry (Registro de Turismo de Andalucía). Each property must have a unique registration number.https://www.juntadeandalucia.es/organismos/turismoculturaydeporte/areas/turismo/registro-turismo.html Property\">\n\t<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"max-image-preview:large\">\n\t<meta name=\"author\" content=\"PropertyList\">\n\t<li